Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:31.74,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 ATP1000 决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:31.74,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}菲斯 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}3 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}1-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}0{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 蒂亚福 · 赛后捧杯致辞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and Francis, we would love
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯，我们想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:21.60,EN,,0,0,0,,to hear a few words from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:21.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,听你说几句话。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.04,EN,,0,0,0,,What's up, Cincinnati?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.60,0:00:23.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,怎么样，辛辛那提？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:26.44,EN,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:26.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:30.80,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, first thing first, obviously,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:30.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,呃，首先，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:32.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to congratulate Arthur.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:32.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想恭喜亚瑟。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:33.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Hell of a week, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:33.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周你打得太棒了，兄弟。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:35.44,EN,,0,0,0,,First 1000 title.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:35.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的第一个大师赛冠军。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:36.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Congrats to you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:36.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:40.20,EN,,0,0,0,,And, and your team for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:40.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,也恭喜你的团队，真的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:44.64,EN,,0,0,0,,And then, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:44.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后，当然，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:45.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I got to thank the fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.64,0:00:45.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要谢谢现场的球迷。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.76,0:00:47.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Y'all all week, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.76,0:00:47.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周你们一直都在，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.36,0:00:48.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Seriously emotional stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.36,0:00:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,说真的，太让人感动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:50.16,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys get behind me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们这么支持我，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:54.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate the love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:54.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很感激这份爱。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I go to sleep hearing one, two, three,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我整晚都听着「一、二、三、
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:02.96,EN,,0,0,0,,foe all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.16,0:01:02.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,Foe」，这一整周都是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.96,0:01:06.88,EN,,0,0,0,,So, it's been it's been crazy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.96,0:01:06.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,太疯狂了，兄弟。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:08.64,EN,,0,0,0,,But, thanks again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:08.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,但还是要再谢一声。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.64,0:01:11.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Shout out Bob Moran.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.64,0:01:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢鲍勃·莫兰，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:13.28,EN,,0,0,0,,One of the best TDs we have in our sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:13.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,这项运动最好的总监之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.28,0:01:14.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Super player family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.28,0:01:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,特别为球员着想的一家人，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:15.36,EN,,0,0,0,,All about the players.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:15.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,一切都以球员为先。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:16.88,EN,,0,0,0,,It's been awesome to get to know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.36,0:01:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,能认识你，真的很开心。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy you're running our events
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.88,0:01:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我特别高兴你现在也在管
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:19.68,EN,,0,0,0,,on the men's side now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.72,0:01:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,男子这边的赛事了，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:21.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and not just in Charleston.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,不只是查尔斯顿。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Shout out the Navaro family as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,也要谢谢纳瓦罗一家。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:26.16,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:26.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:28.16,EN,,0,0,0,,best arena we have in the game for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.16,0:01:28.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,巡回赛里最好的场地之一。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.16,0:01:29.36,EN,,0,0,0,,It's not even a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.16,0:01:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一点毫无疑问。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.36,0:01:33.32,EN,,0,0,0,,You guys are stand up, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.36,0:01:33.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们真的很棒，杰夫。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:45.28,EN,,0,0,0,,And then and then of course I want
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:45.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后，当然，我还要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.28,0:01:46.48,EN,,0,0,0,,to thank my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.28,0:01:46.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢我的团队。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:50.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Mark, Brian, I was going to say Phil.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,马克布莱恩，差点叫成菲尔，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:51.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Rob.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:51.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,抱歉，罗布。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I got different physios coming all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.44,0:01:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我这理疗师换得太勤了，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Sorry, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,抱歉，兄弟。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:58.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Rob, A-Rod, Kenny,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:01:58.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,罗布、A-Rod、肯尼、
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:00.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Zack, who came, Ty, who came,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:00.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,扎克来了，泰也来了，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:02.00,EN,,0,0,0,,ton of friends who came out this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周来了好多朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:03.20,EN,,0,0,0,,So, really appreciate y'all, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:03.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很感谢大家，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:04.56,EN,,0,0,0,,It's been a hell of a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:04.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一周太疯狂了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:05.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:07.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, second final we had.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:07.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我们打进的第二个决赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:08.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously, I didn't even think I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:08.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话，我一度以为自己
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:09.36,EN,,0,0,0,,was going to play this event,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.72,0:02:09.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,都打不了这站比赛，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:10.16,EN,,0,0,0,,so to make a final.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.36,0:02:10.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,结果还打进了决赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.16,0:02:11.76,EN,,0,0,0,,We take that and excited to be in New York
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.16,0:02:11.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个结果收下了，很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.76,0:02:12.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.76,0:02:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,一周后在纽约的比赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:14.48,EN,,0,0,0,,And guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.40,0:02:14.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,大家伙，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:18.68,EN,,0,0,0,,please keep supporting American T.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:18.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,也请继续支持美国网球。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:22.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Francis, come on over and join me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:22.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,弗朗西斯，再过来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:24.88,EN,,0,0,0,,over here one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:24.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,跟我一起，最后一次。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:27.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Cincinnati. One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提，一、二、三。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.76,0:02:29.04,EN,,0,0,0,,There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.76,0:02:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:31.74,EN,,0,0,0,,All right, let's bring this
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:31.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,好，我们再请出——
